    w_mc_res_001_overfires_verb_only_heuristic_2026-08-07, 1, "Fix 2026-11-10 (lane p2-wmcres): root cause = _ufr_is_handle_acquire accepted any rt_*_<acquire-verb> name, so value constructors (rt_string_new/rt_array_new -> i64, rt_atomic_int_load) fired. Fix in src/compiler/35.semantics/lint/unwrapped_foreign_resource.spl: a call is a handle acquire only when its same-file extern declares a resource-shaped return (Any or a named non-primitive type) OR its name carries a known resource family token (_ufr_known_family_tokens: file/socket/tcp/mutex/cuda/module/db/...); bool/array returns stay never-handle. Spec test/01_unit/compiler/lint/unwrapped_foreign_resource_spec.spl: 9 new examples (4 false positives silent, 5 true positives incl. rt_io_tcp_socket_create and rt_cuda_module_load still flagged); red 27/31 -> green 31/31. Harness sweep: core_string.spl 23 -> 0, atomic.spl 3 -> 0 findings. Remaining: registry-backed @sffi(handle:)/resource R check is still the sound upgrade path; deny promotion still not done."

